  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "description": "This update removes the \"emSign ECC Root CA - G3\" CA certificate due to\nintermediate CA certificates being compromised.\n\nIn addition, in Ubuntu 22.04 LTS, Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, and Ubuntu 26.04 LTS,\nthe ca-certificates package contained outdated CA certificates. This update\nrefreshes the included certificates to those contained in the 2.90 version\nof the Mozilla certificate authority bundle.",
